# --- Large / local-only data ---
# Logged datasets are tracked deliberately (small CSV/JSON summaries are fine);
# raw high-rate binary logs and SD card dumps should stay local unless curated.
data/raw/*.bin
data/raw/*.dat
*.log

# --- Local only ---
CLAUDE.md
